+   * kKeys_Controls entries and before that mapped control reaches the guest.
+   * control is the stable 0..11 offset in the order
+   * Up,Down,Left,Right,Select,Start,A,B,X,Y,L,R.
+   * Return nonzero to consume both product gestures and their releases. */
+  int (*system_gamepad_control)(int control, int pressed);
